.#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.expect|filter+xml
.# Content conversions
.#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<wikiSpace name="MySpace">
  <wikiDocument name="WebHome">
    <wikiDocumentLocale>
      <p>
        <parameters>
          <entry>
            <string>creation_author</string>
            <string>XWiki.Teo</string>
          </entry>
          <entry>
            <string>creation_date</string>
            <date>2012-08-21 15:37:47.0 UTC</date>
          </entry>
          <entry>
            <string>lastrevision</string>
            <string>1</string>
          </entry>
        </parameters>
      </p>
      <wikiDocumentRevision revision="1">
        <p>
          <parameters>
            <entry>
              <string>revision_author</string>
              <string>XWiki.Teo</string>
            </entry>
            <entry>
              <string>revision_date</string>
              <date>2016-10-11 14:47:37.0 UTC</date>
            </entry>
            <entry>
              <string>revision_comment</string>
              <string></string>
            </entry>
            <entry>
              <string>title</string>
              <string>My Space</string>
            </entry>
            <entry>
              <string>content</string>
              <string>== {{id name="MySpaceHome-Span"/}}Span ==

The followint span is inline:

(% class="confluenceInline confluence_span_content" %)
(((
inline span
)))

~!!!!!!!!

\\

The following span is not inline:

(% class="confluence_span_content" %)
(((
not inline span
)))

~!!!!!!!!!!!!

(% style="color: purple" id="someId" dir="rtl" lang="ro" title="U are hovering this" class="confluenceInline confluence_span_content someClass" %)
(((
This is some content

**Strong **//italic//

{{info title="Proof"}}
That this supports rich content
{{/info}}

\\
)))

This is an

(% style="text-decoration: underline" id="someCoolId" dir="rtl" title="Some text" class="confluenceInline confluence_span_content someCoolClass" %)
(((
inline span
)))

Mkay???

== {{id name="MySpaceHome-BGColor"/}}BGColor ==

(% style="background-color: yellow;" class="confluenceInline confluence_bgcolor_content someClass" %)
(((
SOme content that will have a specific bg color

**Strong **//italic//

{{info title="Proof"}}
That this supports rich content
{{/info}}

\\
)))

This is inline

(% style="background-color: purple;" class="confluenceInline confluence_bgcolor_content someClass" %)
(((
bg color
)))

Wohoo. So happy

== {{id name="MySpaceHome-Highlight"/}}Highlight ==

(% style="background-color: blue;" class="confluenceInline confluence_highlight_content someClass" %)
(((
This will be highlighted! THis is also rich text

\\

**Strong **//italic//

{{info title="Proof"}}
That this supports rich content
{{/info}}

\\
)))

This is inline

(% class="confluenceInline confluence_highlight_content" style="background-color: green;" %)
(((
highlight
)))

Highlightimus maximus

== {{id name="MySpaceHome-tm"/}}tm ==

(% class="confluenceInline confluence_tm_content someClass" %)
(((
Some rich content

**Strong **//italic//

{{info title="Proof"}}
That this supports rich content
{{/info}}

\\
)))^^TM^^

\\

This is an example for an inline

(% class="confluenceInline confluence_tm_content" %)
(((
tmmacro
)))^^TM^^

tm tm tm.

== {{id name="MySpaceHome-reg-tm"/}}reg-tm ==

(% class="confluenceInline confluence_reg-tm_content someClass" %)
(((
Some rich content

**Strong **//italic//

{{info title="Proof"}}
That this supports rich content
{{/info}}

\\
)))^^®^^

This is an example for an inline

(% class="confluenceInline confluence_reg-tm_content" %)
(((
registered trademark
)))^^®^^</string>
            </entry>
            <entry>
              <string>syntax</string>
              <org.xwiki.rendering.syntax.Syntax>
                <type>
                  <name>XWiki</name>
                  <id>xwiki</id>
                  <variants class="empty-list"/>
                </type>
                <version>2.1</version>
              </org.xwiki.rendering.syntax.Syntax>
            </entry>
          </parameters>
        </p>
      </wikiDocumentRevision>
    </wikiDocumentLocale>
  </wikiDocument>
</wikiSpace>
